    The mail daemon is still implemented, I downloaded nethack from
linc.cis.upenn.edu and installed it yesterday on our SUN 4/390 OS 4.0
and the daemon delivers just fine. Check whether mail is defined in
unixconf.h, the line should read

#define MAIL                 /* Deliver mail during the game */

I think this is the default configuration, but I may have changed it.

The only other thing I can think of is several lines further down in
unixconf.h is the line

#define DEF_MAILREADER    "/usr/bin/mail"

Try checking whether this is where your mail is actually sent.
    
